# Day 07 - Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VPC)

## Topics Covered
- What is Amazon VPC?
- Public and Private Subnets
- Internet Gateway (IGW)
- Route Tables
- Security Groups
- Network ACLs (NACL)

## Hands-on
- Explored Amazon VPC Dashboard
- Learned Public and Private Subnets
- Understood Route Tables and Internet Gateway

## Key Learnings
- Amazon VPC provides an isolated virtual network.
- Public subnets allow internet access.
- Private subnets are used for internal resources.
- Security Groups protect EC2 instances.
- NACLs provide subnet-level security.

